<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Pemex details nine mos. sales, exports.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Pemex details nine mos. sales, exports.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) reported its domestic and export sales for the first nine months of the year. Figures are in millions of dollars.</p>
<p>    Item	  First Nine Mos. 1995  First Nine Mos. 1996</p>
<p>  Total			19,882		   23,711</p>
<p>  Domestic Sales*	  13,394		   15,453</p>
<p>    Oil Products	   11,241		   12,864</p>
<p>    Natural Gas		 726		    1,121</p>
<p>    Chemicals		 1,427		    1,468</p>
<p>  Export Sales		6,488		    8,258</p>
<p>    Crude Oil		 5,746		    7,614</p>
<p>    Oil Products		360			250</p>
<p>    Natural Gas		   9			 25</p>
<p>    Chemicals		   373			369</p>
<p>Legend: Statement is unaudited, * gross sales at consumer prices, includes indirect taxes</p>
<p>--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728 7903.</p>
</text>
